he manifest can then pass its check, and Line 319 reports `archived` despite missing evidence. Reject or neutralize inherited selection settings while preserving remote connection settings.","id":"8a3cd4550b5d1f6e0329118bae4a766ad3694fa723baa3819871c8462bf4524e","intervals":[[86,86]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Prevent inherited rclone filters from producing false success."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"dfeb536cb0bffee3ab5e878ba9d3ac07a1770743","body":"**Return exit code 2 for argument errors.**\n\nIf `--target` is missing, Line 196 returns a validation failure, but this line exits 1. Callers cannot distinguish invalid arguments from operation errors. Preserve usage-error classification and return exit code 2.\n\nAs per coding guidelines, I1 requires: “Exit codes: 0 clean, 1 thrown error, 2 arg error, 3 needs-human.”","id":"0a18c341a046c13084b20fb2a16b6e1c1bc31c4fbae15ee2f136b02b8034f7c7","intervals":[[349,349]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Return exit code 2 for argument errors."}],"head":"9f6244fac8b3b6c556fdef3a0635eec369af52c7","head_tree":"51ba50b1b1dd4985afa637ff27d9e12676620073","input_scope":[{"blob":"dfeb536cb0bffee3ab5e878ba9d3ac07a1770743","intervals":[[1,350]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs"}],"job_id":"4c33e4140663b12356f826ecb6ef279309bd4fbf24af2955da7f4e2a004f4175:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"dfeb536cb0bffee3ab5e878ba9d3ac07a1770743","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"dfeb536cb0bffee3ab5e878ba9d3ac07a1770743","intervals":[[4,4],[253,255],[262,262],[308,30